<h2 style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; color: #2a2050; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;">An access request is waiting</h2>

<p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; color: #2a2050;">Hi <%= @approver.first_name %>,</p>

<p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; color: #2a2050;"><strong><%= @requester.full_name %></strong> (<%= @requester.email %>) asks for access to <strong><%= @application.name %></strong>. If you approve, Weave adds them to the <strong><%= @request.group.name %></strong> group.</p>

<p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #5d5584; font-size: 13px;">Their reason:</p>
<blockquote style="margin: 0 0 24px 0; padding: 12px 16px; border-left: 3px solid #ebe3f9; color: #2a2050; white-space: pre-line;"><%= @request.reason %></blockquote>

<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin: 8px 0 24px 0;">
  <tr>
    <td style="border-radius: 8px; background-color: #6c3ec1;">
      <a href="<%= @group_url %>" style="display: inline-block; padding: 12px 28px; background-color: #6c3ec1; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; font-family: 'Geist', -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;">
        Review the request
      </a>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>

<div style="margin-top: 32px; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid #ebe3f9; color: #5d5584; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6;">
  <p style="margin: 0;"><%= @why %></p>
</div>
